# Pinned SHA-256 digests for the Go toolchain archives the signed release build
# may download.
#
# This file is the trust anchor. The builder is self-hosted, so its cache lives
# on a machine whose filesystem is not part of the reviewed artefact; a digest
# recorded there could be rewritten by whatever rewrote the cache. A digest that
# only changes through a reviewed commit cannot.
#
# Format is `sha256sum -c` compatible: <digest>  <filename>
#
# To add a version, take the digest from https://go.dev/dl/?mode=json (the
# `sha256` field of the darwin-arm64 archive), never from the download itself.
984521ae978a5377c7d782fd2dd953291840d7d3d0bd95781a1f32f16d94a006  go1.25.6.darwin-arm64.tar.gz
